<title>HONG KONG: SocGen-Crosby names Asian technical research head.</title>
<headline>SocGen-Crosby names Asian technical research head.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>SocGen-Crosby said on Tuesday it had appointed Thomas Schroeder as head of technical research for the Asian region.</p>
<p>Schroeder, who worked for UBS prior to his new appointment, will be based in Hong Kong, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Technical research is a new service offered by Soc-Gen Crosby, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
